cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use pythtqc, please cite the paper its stable real-space invariants
  come from, given below as the preferred citation, and the package itself.
title: pythtqc
abstract: >-
  Crystalline-symmetry diagnostics for PythTB tight-binding models: the space
  group a Hamiltonian obeys, the corep content of its bands, whether that
  content could be an atomic limit, and its symmetry indicator and stable
  real-space invariants.
type: software
authors:
